{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:48469b391039dab49f305884486eded015d1bedd9ed3588cead034777b00e63f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:956c8307ea3b3f3f1af6a5e6c25a4cd78b858cde7e63f4bc62dd2b495108bc10",
      "text": "将祝福之意寄托于乐音",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce7976472a260532e8fa7a0fd244e144137effd4bdd80645608a1348d697a7c3",
      "text": "随着圭的生日日益临近，\n丽正在为该送上怎样的祝福而苦恼。\n他与制作人商量后，决定去向圭本人\n询问生日是否有想要的东西，\n然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76b5daac3e3067c25ba6401b0d0a6e691ba2a7d57a1e9d0260a835200e13b64a",
      "text": "距离都筑先生过来，\n还剩一点时间吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8320ab0d8c1e4a34007aee037c095ae15097e6596e3ec6ad7d15598c6b384a9",
      "text": "为了能带来一场精彩的演奏，\n虽然已经积累了充分的练习……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:525a73e540d23cde22b3107c08b649f6f6890b147985c93b3aca8896f2663bf2",
      "text": "但像这样静静等待着，\n还是难以平静下来啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e5b11ec4b9adf7db7ea2c51334ae8f157171cdaf5af67b33ffa1a16073a4cff",
      "text": "要是在训练室的话，\n就算发出声音，\n应该也不会打扰到别人吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02d8f44bde6dc6e44cd8e9b8690a6e1857c68dc1433c267a2022940db9ef0442",
      "text": "以防万一，\n在最后再进行一次\n彩排吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:311bccfe31711c9ed63d04f15701557d839b2df3f7d887617d71d7328919da1c",
      "text": "丽先生，今天谢谢你\n带来这么美妙的演奏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4a91f83cc04183a3e81eba2a6a0fb845ef5d57f39dc6223e96e66cb5ad60adf",
      "text": "能让您感到高兴，\n真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f442ade9d2decbd23722abc6345566437fa25946c1d9356987b2338b94a740b5",
      "text": "下次有机会的话，\n我也想和你一起合奏呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2034e6ddab651df66c026f623040c88c5d2ab289c0f52c4d8ad534d3ff66caa5",
      "text": "好的，一定。\n我也很想和都筑先生一起\n进行演奏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b26b7548590e1770520bf79739b80517bbe1269a972c0a2ac8cc96f55c8b930",
      "text": "两个人一起演奏的话，\n选什么样的曲子好呢，\n得先好好想一想才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
